        <name xml:lang="en">Fuel cell system assembly, 1 kWe, proton exchange membrane (PEM)</name>
        <unitName xml:lang="en">unit</unitName>
        <comment xml:lang="en">Full flow name: Fuel cell system assembly, 1 kWe, proton exchange membrane (PEM)
Operational time of 20,000 hours at power of 1 kWe. Due to the degradation effects the hydrogen consumption must be increased to always generate the power of 1 kWe. Because of dynamic operational regime 5 replacements of the PEMFC stack are included (lifetime of 3'800 hours per stack), while the BoP lasts the whole operational time. {2;5;1;2;3;5;3;}
BAFU mapping audit: {"bafu source exchange index": 1}</comment>
